{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe day was long, but the company in Giessen was excellent. We drank local wine with the professors; I find their arguments as dry as their cellar, but their hospitality is warm. The travelers for Frankfurt departed, leaving me with a Jewish schoolmaster, a man of surprising wit and good taste. We walked the Lahn past Weilburg. The old princely residence looks neglected, a fine ruin. I paid four Kreuzer for a simple meal at a wayside inn; the bread was stale, but the river air was crisp. I am tired, but the walk did me good. I think of Karl and Immanuel only in the sense that I hope your health is steady. Do not worry about my expenses; I am managing well. The light on the water this evening was quite striking, though I have no time to paint it. I shall write again tomorrow if the post allows.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795219298,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":199,"prompt_tokens":1119,"total_tokens":1318,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-w5SbF2nP0i0VyRUTv8vD9ZonSsjkzfl8","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1119,"prompt_ms":1156.796,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0337765862377122,"prompt_per_second":967.326996289752,"predicted_n":199,"predicted_ms":4791.098,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.197464646464645,"predicted_per_second":41.32664370463723}}